<title>FRANCE: Eurostar refusing bookings until Monday after fire.</title>
<headline>Eurostar refusing bookings until Monday after fire.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ticket agents for Eurostar trains through the Channel Tunnel said on Wednesday they were refusing bookings until Monday after a fire on a freight shuttle closed the Eurotunnel Franco-British link .</p>
<p>&quot;We're not accepting any reservations for any trains before Monday,&quot; a booking agent said. &quot;We hope we're erring on the side of caution.&quot;</p>
</text>
